# Line-ending policy.
#
# Git for Windows ships with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites text files to
# CRLF on checkout. Every script below either runs inside a Linux container or
# is executed by a POSIX shell, and CRLF breaks them: the shebang line parses
# but the next line carries a trailing \r, so `set -eu` is read as `set -eu\r`
# and the shell aborts with "illegal option". Pinning eol=lf makes the checkout
# match the blob regardless of the contributor's autocrlf setting.
#
# Two ways this bites today:
#   • Scripts bind-mounted into containers (scripts/property_catalog_oss/*.sh
#     into property-catalog-*-bootstrap) fail at run time.
#   • entrypoint.sh is COPYed into the backend image and invoked as
#     ENTRYPOINT ["bash", "./entrypoint.sh"], so an image built on Windows
#     fails to start at all.

*.sh            text eol=lf

# Shell scripts without a .sh extension — bin/install is the documented
# self-host entry point, bin/dev the contributor one (CONTRIBUTING.md), and
# futureagi/bin/temporal-worker is exec'd inside the container on the
# production path. deploy/standalone/bin/* is COPYed into the standalone image.
bin/dev                             text eol=lf
bin/e2e                             text eol=lf
bin/install                         text eol=lf
bin/uninstall                       text eol=lf
deploy/standalone/bin/*             text eol=lf
futureagi/bin/temporal-worker       text eol=lf
futureagi/bin/test                  text eol=lf

# Container and SQL inputs read by Linux tooling.
Dockerfile*     text eol=lf
*.sql           text eol=lf

# bin/update compares these files byte for byte with the digests a release
# signs (deploy/update/deployment-files.txt), and runs bin/update with bash:
# keep them LF on every checkout, including a Windows clone used from WSL.
bin/update text eol=lf
deploy/update/** text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
docker-compose.distributed.yml text eol=lf
deploy/docker-compose.production.yml text eol=lf
deploy/docker-compose.host-status.standalone.yml text eol=lf
deploy/docker-compose.host-status.distributed.yml text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
deploy/.env.production.example text eol=lf
agentcc-gateway/config.example.yaml text eol=lf
deploy/clickhouse/users.d/** text eol=lf
deploy/standalone/clickhouse/** text eol=lf
futureagi/.ci/clickhouse-storage-policy.xml text eol=lf
futureagi/config/peerdb/temporal-dynamicconfig.yaml text eol=lf
futureagi/scripts/property_catalog_oss/** text eol=lf
futureagi/tracer/services/clickhouse/v2/observed_catalog/** text eol=lf
